Subject: Your claim against Ocean Healthcare Ltd

We deny the claim. There is no outstanding debt: all invoices for 2009 have been paid, certain discounts are due to us which you have not credited, and goods were not delivered in respect of certain invoices. For the invoices from April 2008 to December 2008 we never raised the orders and the goods were never delivered, and you have not disclosed any order confirmations from us for "the alleged invoices from April 2008 to December 2008". Delivery notes are missing for some of them.

